@* ACT in the nav band, the lead's call to action and Organize's "Who to
   call": each opens the Act dialog on Your officials. Where the dialog holds
   nothing yet, or one of Your officials' own views, that is its radio, and it
   opens in place. Where it holds another view (an explainer, the directory,
   an official), the radio would reopen that view, so the trigger loads /act
   instead, in full, as every link into the dialog does. *@

@if (InPlace)
{
    <label class="@Class" for="act-open">@ChildContent</label>
}
else
{
    <a class="@Class" href="@ActPaths.Start" data-enhance-nav="false">@ChildContent</a>
}

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Class { get; set; } = "";

    [Parameter] public bool InPlace { get; set; }

    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
